      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 4.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Yeah, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.46,
      "end_seconds": 13.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "come in please sit how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.82,
      "end_seconds": 18.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Well, I've been having dark urine once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.48,
      "end_seconds": 22.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.96,
      "end_seconds": 38.27,
      "duration_seconds": 14.31,
      "text": "Ever since... since this morning, really. As for aching muscles in my thighs, I honestly can't say when that began. It It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.32,
      "end_seconds": 46.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "have you had dark urine once before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.49,
      "end_seconds": 54.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.08,
      "end_seconds": 60.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.38,
      "end_seconds": 74.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.5,
      "end_seconds": 105.55,
      "duration_seconds": 12.05,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 14, temperature is 36.8 degrees, saturation 99 percent. And pulse is 74 beats a minute, BP is 124 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.82,
      "end_seconds": 108.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.43,
      "end_seconds": 123.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.95,
      "end_seconds": 127.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.46,
      "end_seconds": 148.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "The thigh muscles are tender and the strength is slightly reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.57,
      "end_seconds": 154.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.49,
      "end_seconds": 169.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Have you had any joint swelling or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.92,
      "end_seconds": 174.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.36,
      "end_seconds": 181.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.86,
      "end_seconds": 183.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.03,
      "end_seconds": 188.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "sure. Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.15,
      "end_seconds": 193.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "no, that that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.68,
      "end_seconds": 203.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.98,
      "end_seconds": 207.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.69,
      "end_seconds": 210.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Alright, and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.17,
      "end_seconds": 213.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.6,
      "end_seconds": 220.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "so, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.97,
      "end_seconds": 224.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.63,
      "end_seconds": 226.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.64,
      "end_seconds": 232.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.29,
      "end_seconds": 236.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.55,
      "end_seconds": 241.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.94,
      "end_seconds": 245.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.62,
      "end_seconds": 251.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I've got high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.49,
      "end_seconds": 263.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "alright, high cholesterol, that matches what I have here what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.23,
      "end_seconds": 275.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night. Paracetamol. I take it 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.04,
      "end_seconds": 280.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.42,
      "end_seconds": 289.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to erythromycin, but I don't remember what reaction I had"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.24,
      "end_seconds": 307.4,
      "duration_seconds": 16.16,
      "text": "putting it all together, it points towards muscle symptoms possibly from the cholesterol tablet that's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more we shouldn't forget a low thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.13,
      "end_seconds": 309.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.29,
      "end_seconds": 326.31,
      "duration_seconds": 15.02,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with muscle symptoms possibly from the cholesterol tablet do well once it's treated properly i'm going to order a creatine kinase test, for muscle aches"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 327.59,
      "end_seconds": 329.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "The earliest is Wednesday, 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.1,
      "end_seconds": 352.76,
      "duration_seconds": 19.66,
      "text": "we will pause the statin for a few weeks while we check the blood tests if the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department i'd like to see you again after the results that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.18,
      "end_seconds": 361.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "let me think, I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.85,
      "end_seconds": 364.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
  ]
